    <h1>Khopra Ridge vs Mardi Himal Trek: Which Is Better?</h1>
    <p class="krm-hero-sub">A wide Himalayan panorama with quiet villages, or a short, popular ridge right under Fishtail? We compare views, crowds, villages, teahouses and difficulty so you can choose the right trek.</p>
    <div class="krm-byline">
      <span>By <strong>Discover Parbat</strong></span>
      <span>Published <strong>24 October 2026</strong></span>
      <span>8 min read</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

